  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Break the cycle with Digital School for Nairobi</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">We assist children living in Nairobi&apos;s slums by building schools, providing medical care, and establishing orphanages. We offer promising students hotel training at Italian cooking academy, which has been proven to be effective in responding to unemployment. The next phase involves creating the first digital high school and vocational campus for students in Nairobi&apos;s slums. It will enable these students to stand out from their peers and secure good job, regardless of their background.</narrative>
  </description>
